sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student / Admin
    participant Client as React 18 Client
    participant Router as Express Auth Router
    participant Ctrl as Auth Controller
    participant Security as Bcrypt & JWT
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas
    participant Blacklist as TokenBlacklist (TTL)

    Note over User,DB: REGISTRATION & LOGIN LIFECYCLE
    User->>Client: Enters credentials & submits form
    Client->>Router: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    Router->>Ctrl: invoke login()
    Ctrl->>DB: findOne({ email: cleanEmail })
    DB-->>Ctrl: returns User Document
    Ctrl->>Security: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    Security-->>Ctrl: password verified (True)
    Ctrl->>Security: signJWT({ id, jti: uuid() }, secret, 7d)
    Security-->>Ctrl: returns Signed Token
    Ctrl-->>Router: setCookie('token', HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax)
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK { success: true, token, user }
    Client-->>User: Navigate to /dashboard (Session active)

    Note over User,DB: SECURE LOGOUT & SERVER-SIDE REVOCATION
    User->>Client: Clicks "Logout"
    Client->>Router: POST /api/auth/logout (Bearer Token + Cookie)
    Router->>Ctrl: invoke logout()
    Ctrl->>Blacklist: create({ token, userId, expiresAt })
    Blacklist-->>Ctrl: Token blacklisted
    Ctrl-->>Router: clearCookie('token') & no-store headers
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK { message: "Session Invalidated" }
    Client->>Client: localStorage.clear() & flush AuthContext
    Client-->>User: Redirect to /login